Date: Wed, 2 Sep 2026 16:20:30 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] fix(libobs): publish borrowed video through a safe mailbox

Keep graphics teardown independent from borrowed callback latency by copying mapped frames into preallocated generation slots. The worker releases the mailbox lock before callbacks and teardown joins after pending writes and callbacks finish.

Agent-Role: Forge
Agent-Thread: /root/forge_253_libobs_core
Work-Unit: ZabLaboratory/Pulsar#253
Issue: 253
ADR-Revision: draft-r2-dual-lane-20260828
Evidence: borrowed-mailbox-static-tests; telemetry-selector-table; sequential-patch-stack
